# moonlit_gold - bat_moonlit, slime_moonlit, rat_moonlit
# The Camp Fields' deep roster, wave 21 and beyond. Rank-matched to shadow_purple
# step for step and lifted bright and warm, so a moonlit enemy reads as pale light
# against the deep forest rather than as a second purple. The low steps keep brown
# in them so the shading still reads as a body; only the top two go properly gold.
# The rat maps its three fur greys onto steps 2-4 (fur is less luminous than a
# slime) and keeps its accent_mauve ears, nose, feet and tail. Its eye, which was
# the blue 306082, goes to 3d2f14 or it vanishes into the new coat.
