# skeleton - castle (Pallid Keep) skeleton mob (2026-10-27). Bone is a WARM ivory so it
# stands off the deep blue floor and stays apart from the lilac-white spectre ramp.
# Helmet and shoulder pads are dark neutral iron, darker and less blue than the keep's
